Subject: [PATCH] E-Ink: opaque surfaces and explicit black-white state roles

Change-Id: I825799816df9cfe11b4d43469b1f69f375e60d93

In the light monochrome scheme the Android custom shade roles (EinkCustomColors) are opaque: white surfaces, black active and on-inactive roles, light grey for disabled, without the tone-delta contrast constraints. Other schemes are unchanged.

